{"articleNo":"69108","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=69108&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단]2012 창업캠프 모집 연장-해외신기술견학관련 마일리지 지급","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.02","hit":"4132","attachments":[{"name":"창업 캠프 참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=69108&attachNo=72065"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">창업에 관심이 있는 재학생 및 창업동아리를 대상으로 창업에 대한 관심도 제고와 네트워킹 강화를 통한 창업 분위기 확산을 위해 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 학생 창업 캠프를 실시하고자 하오니 금오공대 학생들의 많은 관심과 참여를 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">*해외신기술견학 관련 마일리지 지급 예정&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 캠프일정 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2012</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">16</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)~17</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">토</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) &lt;1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">박 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 모집인원 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선착순 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">40</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 참가대상 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응용수학과를 제외한 학부 재학생 및 창업동아리 팀원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 캠프내용 :</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업전문가 초청 강연</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사업계획서 작성 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우수발표사례</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선배 창업 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">CEO </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">멘토링</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업에 관심있는 학생들간의 교류 및 만남의 장 마련 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 참가비 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">무료</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6. 장 소 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호텔 금오산</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구미</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span styl